{"id":"presse","lemma":"Presse","pos":"noun","rank":1503,"glosses":["press (device used to apply pressure)","press (printed media)"],"ipa":"/ˈpʁɛsə/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/4/49/De-Presse.ogg/De-Presse.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"genitive":"Presse","plural":"Pressen"},"formAudio":{"Pressen":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/1/17/LL-Q188_%28deu%29-Sebastian_Wallroth-Pressen.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Ich presse eine Orange aus.","en":"I'm squeezing an orange.","words":[{"g":"I"},null,{"g":"a"},{"g":"orange"},{"g":"out of / from"}]},{"text":"Die Presse bestätigte die Gerüchte.","en":"The press confirmed the rumors.","words":[{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"to confirm","l":"bestätigen"},{"g":"the"},{"g":"rumor / rumour","l":"Gerücht"}]},{"text":"Der Premierminister traf sich mit der Presse.","en":"The Prime Minister met with the press.","words":[{"g":"the"},{"g":"prime minister"},{"g":"to meet","l":"treffen"},{"g":"oneself"},{"g":"with"},{"g":"the"},null]},{"text":"Ich möchte wissen, wer die Geschichte an die Presse weitergeleitet hat.","en":"I'd like to know who leaked the story to the papers.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to like","l":"mögen"},{"g":"to know"},{"g":"who"},{"g":"the"},{"g":"history"},{"g":"at / on"},{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"to forward","l":"weiterleiten"},{"g":"has","l":"haben"}]},{"text":"In einer Demokratie ist es wichtig, dass die Presse unabhängig ist.","en":"In a democracy, it is important that the press be independent.","words":[{"g":"in"},{"g":"a / one","l":"ein"},{"g":"democracy"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"it"},{"g":"important"},{"g":"that"},{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"independently"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"}]}]}